{"id": "1320-122617-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "1320", "reference_text": "NOTWITHSTANDING THE HIGH RESOLUTION OF HAWKEYE HE FULLY COMPREHENDED ALL THE DIFFICULTIES AND DANGER HE WAS ABOUT TO INCUR", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/1320-122617-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 7.835, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "1320-122617-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "1320", "reference_text": "IN HIS RETURN TO THE CAMP HIS ACUTE AND PRACTISED INTELLECTS WERE INTENTLY ENGAGED IN DEVISING MEANS TO COUNTERACT A WATCHFULNESS AND SUSPICION ON THE PART OF HIS ENEMIES THAT HE KNEW WERE IN NO DEGREE INFERIOR TO HIS OWN", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/1320-122617-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 14.055, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "1320-122617-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "1320", "reference_text": "IN OTHER WORDS WHILE HE HAD IMPLICIT FAITH IN THE ABILITY OF BALAAM'S ASS TO SPEAK HE WAS SOMEWHAT SKEPTICAL ON THE SUBJECT OF A BEAR'S SINGING AND YET HE HAD BEEN ASSURED OF THE LATTER ON THE TESTIMONY OF HIS OWN EXQUISITE ORGANS", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/1320-122617-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 13.585, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "1320-122617-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "1320", "reference_text": "THERE WAS SOMETHING IN HIS AIR AND MANNER THAT BETRAYED TO THE SCOUT THE UTTER CONFUSION OF THE STATE OF HIS MIND", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/1320-122617-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 6.285, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "1320-122617-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "1320", "reference_text": "THE INGENIOUS HAWKEYE WHO RECALLED THE HASTY MANNER IN WHICH THE OTHER HAD ABANDONED HIS POST AT THE BEDSIDE OF THE SICK WOMAN WAS NOT WITHOUT HIS SUSPICIONS CONCERNING THE SUBJECT OF SO MUCH SOLEMN DELIBERATION", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/1320-122617-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 12.26, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "260-123440-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "260", "reference_text": "AND HOW ODD THE DIRECTIONS WILL LOOK", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/260-123440-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 2.165, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "260-123440-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "260", "reference_text": "POOR ALICE", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/260-123440-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 1.74, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "260-123440-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "260", "reference_text": "IT WAS THE WHITE RABBIT RETURNING SPLENDIDLY DRESSED WITH A PAIR OF WHITE KID GLOVES IN ONE HAND AND A LARGE FAN IN THE OTHER HE CAME TROTTING ALONG IN A GREAT HURRY MUTTERING TO HIMSELF AS HE CAME OH THE DUCHESS THE DUCHESS", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/260-123440-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 14.715, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "260-123440-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "260", "reference_text": "OH WON'T SHE BE SAVAGE IF I'VE KEPT HER WAITING", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/260-123440-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 3.585, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "260-123440-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "260", "reference_text": "ALICE TOOK UP THE FAN AND GLOVES AND AS THE HALL WAS VERY HOT SHE KEPT FANNING HERSELF ALL THE TIME SHE WENT ON TALKING DEAR DEAR HOW QUEER EVERYTHING IS TO DAY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/260-123440-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 12.02, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "2961-960-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "2961", "reference_text": "HE PASSES ABRUPTLY FROM PERSONS TO IDEAS AND NUMBERS AND FROM IDEAS AND NUMBERS TO PERSONS FROM THE HEAVENS TO MAN FROM ASTRONOMY TO PHYSIOLOGY HE CONFUSES OR RATHER DOES NOT DISTINGUISH SUBJECT AND OBJECT FIRST AND FINAL CAUSES AND IS DREAMING OF GEOMETRICAL FIGURES LOST IN A FLUX OF SENSE", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/2961-960-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 27.18, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "2961-960-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "2961", "reference_text": "THE INFLUENCE WITH THE TIMAEUS HAS EXERCISED UPON POSTERITY IS DUE PARTLY TO A MISUNDERSTANDING", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/2961-960-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 8.25, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "2961-960-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "2961", "reference_text": "IN THE SUPPOSED DEPTHS OF THIS DIALOGUE THE NEO PLATONISTS FOUND HIDDEN MEANINGS AND CONNECTIONS WITH THE JEWISH AND CHRISTIAN SCRIPTURES AND OUT OF THEM THEY ELICITED DOCTRINES QUITE AT VARIANCE WITH THE SPIRIT OF PLATO", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/2961-960-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 15.35, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "2961-960-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "2961", "reference_text": "THEY WERE ABSORBED IN HIS THEOLOGY AND WERE UNDER THE DOMINION OF HIS NAME WHILE THAT WHICH WAS TRULY GREAT AND TRULY CHARACTERISTIC IN HIM HIS EFFORT TO REALIZE AND CONNECT ABSTRACTIONS WAS NOT UNDERSTOOD BY THEM AT ALL", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/2961-960-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 17.315, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "2961-960-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "2961", "reference_text": "THERE IS NO DANGER OF THE MODERN COMMENTATORS ON THE TIMAEUS FALLING INTO THE ABSURDITIES OF THE NEO PLATONISTS", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/2961-960-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 8.22, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "3575-170457-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "3575", "reference_text": "AND OFTEN HAS MY MOTHER SAID WHILE ON HER LAP I LAID MY HEAD SHE FEARED FOR TIME I WAS NOT MADE BUT FOR ETERNITY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/3575-170457-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 8.23, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "3575-170457-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "3575", "reference_text": "WHY ARE WE TO BE DENIED EACH OTHER'S SOCIETY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/3575-170457-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 2.99, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "3575-170457-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "3575", "reference_text": "WHY ARE WE TO BE DIVIDED", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/3575-170457-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 2.11, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "3575-170457-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "3575", "reference_text": "SURELY IT MUST BE BECAUSE WE ARE IN DANGER OF LOVING EACH OTHER TOO WELL OF LOSING SIGHT OF THE CREATOR IN IDOLATRY OF THE CREATURE", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/3575-170457-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 7.595, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "3575-170457-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "3575", "reference_text": "WE USED TO DISPUTE ABOUT POLITICS AND RELIGION", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/3575-170457-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 3.105, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "5639-40744-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "5639", "reference_text": "ELEVEN O'CLOCK HAD STRUCK IT WAS A FINE CLEAR NIGHT THEY WERE THE ONLY PERSONS ON THE ROAD AND THEY SAUNTERED LEISURELY ALONG TO AVOID PAYING THE PRICE OF FATIGUE FOR THE RECREATION PROVIDED FOR THE TOLEDANS IN THEIR VALLEY OR ON THE BANKS OF THEIR RIVER", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/5639-40744-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 15.77, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "5639-40744-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "5639", "reference_text": "SECURE AS HE THOUGHT IN THE CAREFUL ADMINISTRATION OF JUSTICE IN THAT CITY AND THE CHARACTER OF ITS WELL DISPOSED INHABITANTS THE GOOD HIDALGO WAS FAR FROM THINKING THAT ANY DISASTER COULD BEFAL HIS FAMILY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/5639-40744-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 12.44, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "5639-40744-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "5639", "reference_text": "RODOLFO AND HIS COMPANIONS WITH THEIR FACES MUFFLED IN THEIR CLOAKS STARED RUDELY AND INSOLENTLY AT THE MOTHER THE DAUGHTER AND THE SERVANT MAID", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/5639-40744-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 8.91, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "5639-40744-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "5639", "reference_text": "IN A MOMENT HE COMMUNICATED HIS THOUGHTS TO HIS COMPANIONS AND IN THE NEXT MOMENT THEY RESOLVED TO TURN BACK AND CARRY HER OFF TO PLEASE RODOLFO FOR THE RICH WHO ARE OPEN HANDED ALWAYS FIND PARASITES READY TO ENCOURAGE THEIR BAD PROPENSITIES AND THUS TO CONCEIVE THIS WICKED DESIGN TO COMMUNICATE IT APPROVE IT RESOLVE ON RAVISHING LEOCADIA AND TO CARRY THAT DESIGN INTO EFFECT WAS THE WORK OF A MOMENT", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/5639-40744-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 27.12, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "5639-40744-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "5639", "reference_text": "THEY DREW THEIR SWORDS HID THEIR FACES IN THE FLAPS OF THEIR CLOAKS TURNED BACK AND SOON CAME IN FRONT OF THE LITTLE PARTY WHO HAD NOT YET DONE GIVING THANKS TO GOD FOR THEIR ESCAPE FROM THOSE AUDACIOUS MEN", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/5639-40744-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 12.475, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "6930-75918-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "6930", "reference_text": "CONCORD RETURNED TO ITS PLACE AMIDST THE TENTS", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/6930-75918-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 3.505, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "6930-75918-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "6930", "reference_text": "THE ENGLISH FORWARDED TO THE FRENCH BASKETS OF FLOWERS OF WHICH THEY HAD MADE A PLENTIFUL PROVISION TO GREET THE ARRIVAL OF THE YOUNG PRINCESS THE FRENCH IN RETURN INVITED THE ENGLISH TO A SUPPER WHICH WAS TO BE GIVEN THE NEXT DAY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/6930-75918-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 14.225, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "6930-75918-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "6930", "reference_text": "CONGRATULATIONS WERE POURED IN UPON THE PRINCESS EVERYWHERE DURING HER JOURNEY", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/6930-75918-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 5.025, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "6930-75918-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "6930", "reference_text": "FROM THE RESPECT PAID HER ON ALL SIDES SHE SEEMED LIKE A QUEEN AND FROM THE ADORATION WITH WHICH SHE WAS TREATED BY TWO OR THREE SHE APPEARED AN OBJECT OF WORSHIP THE QUEEN MOTHER GAVE THE FRENCH THE MOST AFFECTIONATE RECEPTION FRANCE WAS HER NATIVE COUNTRY AND SHE HAD SUFFERED TOO MUCH UNHAPPINESS IN ENGLAND FOR ENGLAND TO HAVE MADE HER FORGET FRANCE", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/6930-75918-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 23.315, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "6930-75918-0004", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "6930", "reference_text": "SHE TAUGHT HER DAUGHTER THEN BY HER OWN AFFECTION FOR IT THAT LOVE FOR A COUNTRY WHERE THEY HAD BOTH BEEN HOSPITABLY RECEIVED AND WHERE A BRILLIANT FUTURE OPENED BEFORE THEM", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/6930-75918-0004.wav", "duration_sec": 11.065, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "7127-75947-0000", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "7127", "reference_text": "EVERY ONE COULD OBSERVE HIS AGITATION AND PROSTRATION A PROSTRATION WHICH WAS INDEED THE MORE REMARKABLE SINCE PEOPLE WERE NOT ACCUSTOMED TO SEE HIM WITH HIS ARMS HANGING LISTLESSLY BY HIS SIDE HIS HEAD BEWILDERED AND HIS EYES WITH ALL THEIR BRIGHT INTELLIGENCE BEDIMMED", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/7127-75947-0000.wav", "duration_sec": 17.97, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "7127-75947-0001", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "7127", "reference_text": "UPON THIS MADAME DEIGNED TO TURN HER EYES LANGUISHINGLY TOWARDS THE COMTE OBSERVING", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/7127-75947-0001.wav", "duration_sec": 6.64, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "7127-75947-0002", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "7127", "reference_text": "DO YOU THINK SO SHE REPLIED WITH INDIFFERENCE", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/7127-75947-0002.wav", "duration_sec": 3.235, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
{"id": "7127-75947-0003", "condition": "clean_read_speech", "speaker_id": "7127", "reference_text": "YES THE CHARACTER WHICH YOUR ROYAL HIGHNESS ASSUMED IS IN PERFECT HARMONY WITH YOUR OWN", "audio_path": "v1/datasets/prepared/clean_read_speech/7127-75947-0003.wav", "duration_sec": 5.98, "source_dataset": "LibriSpeech test-clean", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0 (Vassil Panayotov, 2014)", "source_url": "https://www.openslr.org/12/", "ground_truth_provenance": "verbatim from corpus .trans.txt"}
